  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>A light-as-air non comedogenic tinted mineral SPF that provides broad spectrum UVA/UVB protection with sheer buildable coverage for a natural finish.</p><p><strong>Coverage: </strong>Light</p><p><strong><br>Finish: </strong>Natural</p><p><strong><br>Formulation:</strong> Liquid</p><p><br></p><p><strong>SPF: </strong>45<strong><br><br>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></strong>- Zinc Oxide: For broad spectrum UVA/UVB protection.</p><p>- Final Natural Powders: Visibly smooth and blur skin.</p><p>- Lightweight Emollients: For a soft, velvety finish.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Ingredient Callouts:</strong> This product is vegan and cruelty-free.</p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Apply evenly over skin as the final step in your skincare routine.<br>-Wear alone or follow with The Minimalist Perfecting Complexion Foundation and Concealer Stick (sold separately) for added coverage where you need it. <br>-Apply generously 15 minutes before sun exposure.<br>-Reapply every two hours and directly after any physical activity or exposure to water.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">Active Zinc Oxide 15 Inactive Water, C13-15 Alkane, Propanediol, Isoamyl Laurate, Butyloctylsalicylate, Zeamays Starch, Polyglyceryl-4 Diisostearate/Polyhydroxystearate/Sebacate, C15-19 Alkane, Polyhydroxystearic Acid, Coco-Caprylate, Diglycerin, Magnesium Sulfate, Quaternium-90 Bentonite, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Disteardimonium Hectorite, Hydroxyacetophenone, Lauroyl Lysine, Triethyl Citrate, Caprylyl Glycol, Cellulose, Tocopheryl Acetate, Sorbitan Isostearate, Ethylhexylglycerin, Tocopherol, Alumina, Titanium Dioxide (Ci 77891), Iron Oxides (Ci 77491, Ci77492, Ci 77499).<br><br><I><b>Product Disclosures:</b> For external use only. Do not use on damaged or broken skin. When using this product keep out of eyes. Rinse with water to remove. Stop use and ask a doctor if a rash occurs. Keep out of reach out children. If product is swallowed, get medical help or contact a Poison Control Center right away. </i></div></details>",
  "description_html": "<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>A light-as-air non comedogenic tinted mineral SPF that provides broad spectrum UVA/UVB protection with sheer buildable coverage for a natural finish.</p><p><strong>Coverage: </strong>Light</p><p><strong><br>Finish: </strong>Natural</p><p><strong><br>Formulation:</strong> Liquid</p><p><br></p><p><strong>SPF: </strong>45<strong><br><br>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></strong>- Zinc Oxide: For broad spectrum UVA/UVB protection.</p><p>- Final Natural Powders: Visibly smooth and blur skin.</p><p>- Lightweight Emollients: For a soft, velvety finish.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Ingredient Callouts:</strong> This product is vegan and cruelty-free.</p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Apply evenly over skin as the final step in your skincare routine.<br>-Wear alone or follow with The Minimalist Perfecting Complexion Foundation and Concealer Stick (sold separately) for added coverage where you need it. <br>-Apply generously 15 minutes before sun exposure.<br>-Reapply every two hours and directly after any physical activity or exposure to water.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">Active Zinc Oxide 15 Inactive Water, C13-15 Alkane, Propanediol, Isoamyl Laurate, Butyloctylsalicylate, Zeamays Starch, Polyglyceryl-4 Diisostearate/Polyhydroxystearate/Sebacate, C15-19 Alkane, Polyhydroxystearic Acid, Coco-Caprylate, Diglycerin, Magnesium Sulfate, Quaternium-90 Bentonite, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Disteardimonium Hectorite, Hydroxyacetophenone, Lauroyl Lysine, Triethyl Citrate, Caprylyl Glycol, Cellulose, Tocopheryl Acetate, Sorbitan Isostearate, Ethylhexylglycerin, Tocopherol, Alumina, Titanium Dioxide (Ci 77891), Iron Oxides (Ci 77491, Ci77492, Ci 77499).<br><br><I><b>Product Disclosures:</b> For external use only. Do not use on damaged or broken skin. When using this product keep out of eyes. Rinse with water to remove. Stop use and ask a doctor if a rash occurs. Keep out of reach out children. If product is swallowed, get medical help or contact a Poison Control Center right away. </i></div></details>",
